herdr 0.9.5. Prefix is C-b. "<prefix> c" means press C-b, release, then c.
<prefix> ? shows every active binding (/ filters)

Panes
<prefix> v splits right, <prefix> - (minus) splits down
<prefix> h, <prefix> j, <prefix> k and <prefix> l focus panes ala Vim
<prefix> Tab and <prefix> S-Tab cycle panes
<prefix> S-h, S-j, S-k, S-l swap panes
<prefix> z zooms the focused pane
<prefix> r enters resize mode
<prefix> x closes the pane
<prefix> S-p renames the pane
<prefix> e opens the scrollback in an editor

Copy mode
<prefix> [ enters copy mode. h/j/k/l, w/b/e, C-u/C-d move. / and ? search, n/N repeat
v or Space starts a selection, y or Enter copies, q or Esc leaves
Mouse drag copies without copy mode

Tabs
<prefix> c new tab, <prefix> S-t rename, <prefix> S-x close
<prefix> n and <prefix> p next/previous tab, <prefix> 1..9 jump to a tab

Workspaces and agents
<prefix> w opens workspace navigation (Esc leaves)
<prefix> g opens the goto picker: every agent/terminal. / search, b/w/i/d filter blocked/working/idle/done, a all
<prefix> b toggles the sidebar (spaces and agents panel)
<prefix> o jumps to the latest notification's pane
<prefix> S-n new workspace, <prefix> S-w rename, <prefix> S-d close
<prefix> S-g new git worktree workspace

Session
<prefix> q detaches. The server and agents keep running
<prefix> S-r reloads config. <prefix> s opens settings
herdr                                   launch or attach
herdr --remote desk --remote-keybindings server   attach from the laptop (server keys and plugins)
herdr session list / herdr session attach <name>
herdr server stop                       ends the session and stops all panes

Drive other agents (IDs come from JSON output, never from sidebar order)
herdr pane current / herdr pane list / herdr agent list
herdr pane split --current --direction right --no-focus
herdr pane run <pane> "<command>"       sends text and Enter
herdr pane read <pane> --lines 50
herdr pane wait-output <pane> --match "done" --timeout 60000
herdr agent start <name> --kind claude --pane <pane>     kinds include kiro, codex, claude, pi
herdr agent prompt <agent> "<text>" --wait --timeout 600000
herdr agent wait <agent> --until idle
herdr agent read <agent> --lines 80
herdr agent send-keys <agent> esc
herdr agent attach <agent>
